# Routine "Monday list top-up": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every Monday, adds new companies and named people that match your ideal customer so the list never runs dry.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/pg && pi -p "/monday-list-topup"
